  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EGAT Executive Leadership Training Program, through Tuatara Group, LLC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contract funds a Training Program to introduce delegates from the Electricity Generating Authority of Thailand (EGAT) to U.S. technology, regulations and best practices in energy sector modernization. The Training Program delegation will travel to up to three cities in the United States in order to meet with U.S. companies and receive training on new technologies and management best practices to approach todays energy landscape.</narrative>
  </description>
